calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, and May to June in 28. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 57% of normal in September to October and 46% in October to November. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 31054 got 51% of normal that year.</p>"}
